Gaming charge bypass for crDroid
Source snapshot: 2026-10-08.

UPSTREAM SOURCES AND COMPATIBILITY

This distribution contains source-code diffs for crDroid branch 16.0 (Android 16).
Other ROMs are outside the current scope. It is not a ROM image and contains no
vendor binaries, firmware or driver source.

The two patches work as a pair and are not useful separately:

  frameworks/base          GameStateDispatcher pauses charging while a game is in
                           the foreground and restores the previous charging state
                           when it leaves.
  packages/apps/GameSpace  Adds the user-visible threshold option to the in-game
                           panel.

Both only build on mechanisms that already exist in the tree: the LineageOS
charging-control feature (HealthInterface / ChargingControlController) and the
GameSpace in-game options. No kernel node is written directly, no charging driver
is modified, and no vendor interface is added. The charge pause uses the same
LineageOS setter a user would reach through Settings.

